### Recommended User Workflows

- **New user getting started**: Quick Start → connect/create wallet → browse Trenches → check CA Security before first trade.
- **Finding alpha tokens**: Trending/Discover → check holder distribution and insider activity on Token Detail Page → verify via CA Security Checks → trade.
- **Hands-off copy trading**: Rank (find top wallets) → review wallet PnL/win rate → set up Copy Trade with risk parameters.
- **Automated sniping**: Set up Migrated Snipe (auto-buy on Pump.fun → DEX migration) or SnipeX (monitor Twitter for new CAs).
